From 3b151ac97700f51bdf68b23de718cd1295e36011 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:01:25 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Show the failure the playback row holds, and clear it on
 dismiss

The failure notice counted failures so each screen could tell a new one
from the same one read again, a write count kept only to force a read.
The notice now shows while the row holds a failure, a later failure
replaces it, and dismissing the notice clears the row's failure through
a new bridge call, so the next failure shows again.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019wwAR9dZVZXyrPK4PqBSPW
